<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 1280, height: 720 }}>
    <Box style={{
      width: 1280, height: 44, background: '#F3F1E7', flexDirection: 'row',
      alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between',
      paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#2F4A2B', letterSpacing: 2, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>02　方案</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B8A7E', letterSpacing: 2 }}>MedAI</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 2, background: '#2F4A2B' }} />

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 24, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1C1F1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
        一个账号，管全家人的健康档案
      </Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#55544A', marginTop: 6 }}>
        家里每个人是一块小牌子，点开就能对话；天上吊着一块木板，写着全家今天吃了几次药。
      </Text>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 636, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Image src="assets/home.png" style={{ width: 636, height: 462, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6, border: '1px solid #D8D4C4' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8B8A7E', marginTop: 8 }}>
            图 1　草地首页：左栏六份家庭档案，中间绒球医生，天上吊着用药木牌
          </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 30, height: 490, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', paddingBottom: 18, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2DED0' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8ABFEB', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 34 }}>01</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1C1F1A' }}>一个账号，多份档案</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#55544A', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.7, paddingLeft: 34 }}>
              老人不用自己注册。越权在一条 SQL 里挡掉 —— 别人的档案和不存在返回同一个 404。
            </Text>
          </Box>

          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 16, paddingBottom: 18, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2DED0' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8ABFEB', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 34 }}>02</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1C1F1A' }}>三个动作各有入口</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#55544A', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.7, paddingLeft: 34 }}>
              吃药有木牌、看病有问诊、复诊有摘要与时间轴 —— 覆盖"吃、看、说"三件事。
            </Text>
          </Box>

          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 18, paddingBottom: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8ABFEB', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 34 }}>03</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1C1F1A' }}>AI 有明确边界</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#55544A', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.7, paddingLeft: 34 }}>
              不诊断、不开处方、不替用户判断"哪句重要"。判断权留在患者手里。
            </Text>
          </Box>

          <Box style={{
            background: '#2F4A2B', borderRadius: 4, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14,
            paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18, marginTop: 4,
          }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.6, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
              它首先得是个让人愿意在深夜打开的东西，其次才是工具。
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
      position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 40,
      flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between',
      paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B8A7E' }}>广东医科大学 · MedAI</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2F4A2B' }}>04 / 14</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
